    "scenario": "BGP Attribute MED",
    "goals": "• Configure IBGP in AS {{as1_number}} using loopback0 addresses.\n  AS {{as1_number}}: {{router1_name}}, {{router2_name}}, {{router4_name}}\n• Configure EBGP between AS {{as1_number}} and AS {{as2_number}}.\n  AS {{as2_number}}: {{router3_name}}\n• Advertise the {{router3_loopback0_network}} /24 network on router {{router3_name}}.\n• Ensure AS {{as1_number}} will use the link between {{router1_name}} and {{router3_name}} for traffic towards network {{router3_loopback0_network}} /24. You are only allowed to use the MED (metric) BGP attribute for this.",
